  #line-at(197.57pt, 363.17pt, "), where the signal converges toward a stable, high-frequency limit. By ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 377.81pt, "utilizing high-resolution complex refractive index data, the resulting ")
  #set text(font: "Cambria Math", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
