  #line-at(72.024pt, 261.65pt, "universal coordinates across the extinction manifold. ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 284.33pt, "Our findings reveal that for the entire class of dielectric polymers, spectral information density is ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 298.97pt, "non-monotonic. We have identified a universal information bottleneck occurring at the onset of ")
